{
  "info": {
    "name": "Role Permission",
    "description": "CRUD and management endpoints for RolePermission — keyed by Role ObjectId.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "PASTE_YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "roleId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Role ObjectId — used as the URL param for all single-resource requests"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Create Role Permission",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "if (res.success && res.data?.role?._id) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('roleId', res.data.role._id);",
              "  console.log('roleId set:', res.data.role._id);",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"<ROLE_OBJECT_ID>\",\n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"USER.ADD\",\n    \"USER.EDIT\",\n    \"USER.DELETE\",\n    \"USER.GET\",\n    \"CUSTOMER.ADD\",\n    \"CUSTOMER.EDIT\",\n    \"CUSTOMER.DELETE\",\n    \"CUSTOMER.GET\",\n    \"ROLE.ADD\",\n    \"ROLE.EDIT\",\n    \"ROLE.DELETE\",\n    \"ROLE.GET\",\n    \"PRIVACY.ENCRYPT\",\n    \"PRIVACY.DECRYPT\",\n    \"PRIVACY.ENCRYPTVIEW\"\n  ],\n  \"restrictedUsers\": [\n    {\n      \"user\": \"<USER_OBJECT_ID>\",\n      \"modules\": [],\n      \"options\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"expiresAt\": null\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{URL}}/api/v1/role-permissions",
          "host": ["{{URL}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "role-permissions"]
        },
        "description": "Create a new role permission. Auto-saves `role._id` to {{roleId}}.\n\n**Required:** `role`\n**Optional:** `permissions`, `restrictedUsers`, `expiresAt`\n\n`PRIVACY.ENCRYPTVIEW` — user can see encrypted fields as plaintext.\n`PRIVACY.ENCRYPT` / `PRIVACY.DECRYPT` — user can call bulk encrypt/decrypt API."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Get All Role Permissions",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{URL}}/api/v1/role-permissions",
          "host": ["{{URL}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "role-permissions"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "isActive", "value": "true", "description": "Filter by active status (true | false)", "disabled": true },
            { "key": "role", "value": "", "description": "Filter by Role ObjectId", "disabled": true }
          ]
        },
        "description": "List all role permissions.\n\nOptional query params: `isActive=true|false`, `role=<roleId>`"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Role Permission by roleId",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{URL}}/api/v1/role-permissions/{{roleId}}",
          "host": ["{{URL}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "role-permissions", "{{roleId}}"]
        },
        "description": "Get the permission document for a specific Role ObjectId."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Update Role Permission by roleId",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"isActive\": true,\n  \"expiresAt\": null\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{URL}}/api/v1/role-permissions/{{roleId}}",
          "host": ["{{URL}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "role-permissions", "{{roleId}}"]
        },
        "description": "Update a role permission by Role ObjectId.\n\n**Allowed fields:** `permissions`, `restrictedUsers`, `isActive`, `expiresAt`, `client`, `branch`"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Delete Role Permission by roleId",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{URL}}/api/v1/role-permissions/{{roleId}}",
          "host": ["{{URL}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "role-permissions", "{{roleId}}"]
        },
        "description": "Permanently delete the permission document for a Role ObjectId."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Permissions Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Add Permissions",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"BRANCH.ADD\",\n    \"BRANCH.EDIT\",\n    \"BRANCH.DELETE\",\n    \"BRANCH.GET\",\n    \"PRIVACY.ENCRYPTVIEW\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{URL}}/api/v1/role-permissions/{{roleId}}/permissions/add",
              "host": ["{{URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "role-permissions", "{{roleId}}", "permissions", "add"]
            },
            "description": "Add permission strings to the role. Uses `$addToSet` — no duplicates."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Permissions",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"BRANCH.DELETE\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{URL}}/api/v1/role-permissions/{{roleId}}/permissions/remove",
              "host": ["{{URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "role-permissions", "{{roleId}}", "permissions", "remove"]
            },
            "description": "Remove permission strings from the role. Uses `$pull`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Restricted Users Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Restrict User (module / option)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user\": \"<USER_OBJECT_ID>\",\n  \"modules\": [\"PRIVACY\"],\n  \"options\": [\"USER.ADD\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{URL}}/api/v1/role-permissions/{{roleId}}/restrict",
              "host": ["{{URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "role-permissions", "{{roleId}}", "restrict"]
            },
            "description": "Block a specific user from selected modules and/or specific permission options within this role.\n\n**Body:**\n- `user` (required) — User ObjectId\n- `modules` — Array of module names to block entirely (e.g. `[\"PRIVACY\", \"USER\"]`). Blocks all `MODULE.*` permissions.\n- `options` — Array of specific permission strings to block (e.g. `[\"USER.ADD\", \"PRIVACY.ENCRYPTVIEW\"]`). Blocks individual actions without blocking the whole module.\n\nPass both `modules: []` and `options: []` to block the user from **ALL** permissions in this role.\nIf the user already has a restriction entry it is replaced (upsert behaviour).\n\n**Examples:**\n```json\n// Block from everything\n{ \"user\": \"<id>\", \"modules\": [], \"options\": [] }\n\n// Block entire PRIVACY module\n{ \"user\": \"<id>\", \"modules\": [\"PRIVACY\"], \"options\": [] }\n\n// Block only USER.ADD and USER.DELETE (keep rest of USER module)\n{ \"user\": \"<id>\", \"modules\": [], \"options\": [\"USER.ADD\", \"USER.DELETE\"] }\n\n// Block entire USER module + PRIVACY.ENCRYPTVIEW specifically\n{ \"user\": \"<id>\", \"modules\": [\"USER\"], \"options\": [\"PRIVACY.ENCRYPTVIEW\"] }\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Unrestrict User",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user\": \"<USER_OBJECT_ID>\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{URL}}/api/v1/role-permissions/{{roleId}}/unrestrict",
              "host": ["{{URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "role-permissions", "{{roleId}}", "unrestrict"]
            },
            "description": "Fully remove a user from the restricted list, restoring their full role access. Uses `$pull`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
